          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-600">Invoice Payment Terms Explained &rarr;</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="not-prose mt-10 p-8 bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl text-center border border-indigo-100">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Ready to create your invoice?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Use our free invoice generator — no signup required. Download a professional PDF in under 60 seconds.</p>
        <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">Create Free Invoice &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
